rsion\": \"24.0.0\",\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"lib\": [\n      \"es2024\",\n      \"ESNext.Array\",\n      \"ESNext.Collection\",\n      \"ESNext.Iterator\",\n      \"ESNext.Promise\"\n    ],\n    \"module\": \"nodenext\",\n    \"target\": \"es2024\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"node16\"\n  }\n}\n\n```\n\nYou can find the [code here](https://github.com/tsconfig/bases/blob/master/bases/node-lts.json).\n","readmeFilename":"README.md","users":{"flumpus-dev":true}}